@startuml
hide footbox
title Nhân viên xem và đóng gói đơn hàng
actor Employee
participant AdminPortal
participant API
participant AdminOrderService
participant PostgreSQL

Employee->AdminPortal: Mở danh sách đơn chờ xử lý
AdminPortal->API: GET /admin/orders?status=pending
API->AdminOrderService: Verify active employee JWT
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: SELECT paginated orders
PostgreSQL-->AdminOrderService: Order summaries
API-->AdminPortal: 200 order list
Employee->AdminPortal: Mở chi tiết và bấm đóng gói
AdminPortal->API: POST /admin/orders/:orderId/pack
API->AdminOrderService: Validate packing input
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: BEGIN and lock sales_order
PostgreSQL-->AdminOrderService: Pending order
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: INSERT packing record
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: UPDATE order status to packed
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: COMMIT transaction
PostgreSQL-->AdminOrderService: Packed order
API-->AdminPortal: 200 packed order
AdminPortal-->Employee: Hiển thị thông tin đóng gói

@enduml
